  "prefLabel": "He-W 573.09 Safety Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 573.09 Safety Requirements. Wheelchair van providers shall comply with all of the applicable parts of Saf-C 5919.19 and 49 CFR 38.23 to ensure that all wheelchair vans are properly equipped and supplied.\n\nSource. #8563, eff 2-7-06; ss by #10605, eff 5-23-14",
